        <span>BOX</span><i>→</i><span>BOX</span><i>→</i><span>BOX</span>
      </div>
      <p>Everything is a rectangle. Every connection is accepted.</p>
      <div class="comparison-status">NO SEMANTIC CONTEXT</div>
    </article>
    <article class="comparison-panel comparison-panel--signal">
      <div class="comparison-panel__label">ARCHLEX</div>
